s changed\nRunning review with 3 agents in parallel...\n\n<span class=\"done\">✓ claude-code      done    1m 42s   12.4k tok</span>\n<span class=\"done\">✓ codex            done    58s      8.1k tok</span>\n<span class=\"running\">⣷ gemini-cli       running 1m 12s   <span class=\"dim\">…</span></span>\n<span class=\"dim\"></span>\n<span class=\"dim\">(events print as agents finish; current: waiting on gemini)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">\n      <div><b>A. \"Parallel under the hood, sequentially rendered\"</b></div>\n      <div class=\"tradeoffs\">\n        <span class=\"tradeoff-tag pro\">ships fastest</span>\n        <span class=\"tradeoff-tag pro\">no new TUI deps</span>\n        <span class=\"tradeoff-tag con\">feels sequential</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Goroutines spawn in parallel, but the display updates are serial <code>fmt.Println</code>s as each agent's state flips. The spinner in the last row is fake — just the last-printed log line. Delivers speedup but not the visual dashboard.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ========== OPTION B ========== -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"tui\">Reviewing feat/picker vs main: 3 commits, 7 files changed\nRunning 3 agents — Ctrl+C to cancel all\n\n<span class=\"row-sep\">────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n<span class=\"done\">  ✓  claude-code      <span class=\"dim\">done</span>      1m 42s   12.4k tok</span>\n<span class=\"done\">  ✓  codex            <span class=\"dim\">done</span>        58s    8.1k tok</span>\n<span class=\"running\">  ⣷  gemini-cli       <span class=\"dim\">running</span>   1m 12s   <span class=\"dim\">—</span></span>\n<span class=\"row-sep\">────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n<span class=\"dim\">2 of 3 complete</span></div>\n    <div class=\"caption\">\n      <div><b>B. \"Parallel execution + live static table\"</b> ⭐ <span class=\"dim\">recommended</span></div>\n      <div class=\"tradeoffs\">\n        <span class=\"