{"parentUuid":"acddaedd-0219-491d-b8df-7329eceb1ab9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_012D9DkhBMR7JddsPRMp29bJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right — a dashboard that tells you \"3 reviews happened\" but doesn't show what any of them found is a half-feature. Let me widen 2.2's scope to include the actually-useful part.\n\n**Revised completion behavior for 2.2:**\n\nAfter all agents finish, the TUI exits and each agent's **full final response** is dumped sequentially to the terminal:\n\n```\n(dashboard stays above as final paint)\n─────── claude-code review ───────\n[full response text — every line, not just a preview]\n\n─────── codex review ───────\n[full response text]\n\n─────── gemini-cli review ───────\n[full response text]\n\n✓ 3 agents done in 2m 14s (3 succeeded, 0 failed)\n  Run `git commit` to attach the review to the next checkpoint.\n```\n\nThis gives 2.2 real standalone value — you actually get to read the reviews, not just watch them happen. Implementation is cheap: each agent's captured stdout buffer (already needed for the preview line in the live dashboard) is printed in full when it completes.\n\nWhat 2.3 still adds on top:\n\n1. **Ctrl+O during the run** — open a full-screen scrollable transcript pane for one agent while the others keep going. Today with 2.2, you can't watch any agent's long-form output until everyone's done; 2.3 lets you check in early on a slow one.\n2. **Aggregated cross-cutting summary** — a unified view like \"claude says X, codex also says X, gemini disagrees on Y\" that synthesizes across agents. Requires intelligent merging.\n3. **AI synthesis** (2.4) — a final agent call that reads all three outputs and produces a meta-review.\n\nSo 2.2 = parallel + dashboard + sequential result dump. 2.3 = drill-in during run + aggregated view. 2.4 = AI meta-review. Each phase genuinely adds something instead of 2.2 being a throwaway prelude.\n\nGood on that revised shape?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":151,"cache_read_input_tokens":537907,"output_tokens":2588,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":151},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2588,"cache_read_input_tokens":537907,"cache_creation_input_tokens":151,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":151,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaLD5TxLYyEhXDaz1PRBW","type":"assistant","uuid":"77cbbd54-9a9d-42c4-a23c-7dd5708f9113","timestamp":"2026-04-23T06:13:28.045Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/entire-review","sessionId":"32ff705a-db92-4346-a9c8-70b631ba581d","version":"2.1.117","gitBranch":"soph/entire-review-2"}
